# Title: DotNET Assembly DLL Loaded Via Office Application
# ID: ff0f2b05-09db-4095-b96d-1b75ca24894a
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Antonlovesdnb
# Date: 2020-02-19
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects any assembly DLL being loaded by an Office Product
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\excel.exe" OR process_path="*\\mspub.exe" OR process_path="*\\onenote.exe" OR process_path="*\\onenoteim.exe" OR process_path="*\\outlook.exe" OR process_path="*\\powerpnt.exe" OR process_path="*\\winword.exe") AND ImageLoaded="C:\\Windows\\assembly\\*")
